    "questions": [
      {
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "A study was conducted to investigate the effect of a new medication on systolic blood pressure. Blood pressure was measured for 8 patients before and after taking the medication:"
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "Participant",
              "Pre-Treatment BP (mmHg)",
              "Post-Treatment BP (mmHg)"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "1",
                "140",
                "150"
              ],
              [
                "2",
                "150",
                "142"
              ],
              [
                "3",
                "135",
                "128"
              ],
              [
                "4",
                "160",
                "180"
              ],
              [
                "5",
                "145",
                "138"
              ],
              [
                "6",
                "155",
                "148"
              ],
              [
                "7",
                "148",
                "170"
              ],
              [
                "8",
                "142",
                "135"
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "right",
              "right"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Please determine if the medication has a significant effect on changing blood pressure at alpha = 0.01."
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "令差值 $d=\\mathrm{Post}-\\mathrm{Pre}$, $H_0:\\mu_d=0$, $H_1:\\mu_d\\ne0$. 差值为 10,-8,-7,20,-7,-7,22,-7, $\\bar d=2$, $s_d=13.1584$, $SE=4.6522$, $t=0.4299$, $df=7$. 双侧 $\\alpha=0.01$ 的临界值为 $\\pm3.4995$, 不拒绝 $H_0$, 无足够证据认为平均血压发生变化"
          }
        ],
        "explanation": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "采用配对 t 检验, 正态性要求针对差值, 不同受试者应独立; 小样本且差值分布条件未说明, 该参数检验结论以差值近似正态为前提"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
          {
