      {
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Suppose you want to test whether smoking status is associated with lung disease in a sample of 200 individuals."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "Lung Disease",
              "No Disease",
              "Total"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Smoker",
                "65",
                "40",
                "105"
              ],
              [
                "Non-smoker",
                "25",
                "75",
                "100"
              ],
              [
                "Total",
                "90",
                "115",
                "205"
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "right",
              "right",
              "right"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Please fill the following table with expected frequencies and perform a Chi-square test at alpha = 0.01 (keep two-decimals during your calculation)."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "Lung Disease",
              "No Disease"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Smoker",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "Non-smoker",
                "",
                ""
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "left",
              "left"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "待确认: 题干称 200 人, 表格各格与边际合计均为 205 人. 若以表格为准, 期望频数依次为 46.10,58.90;43.90,56.10, Pearson $\\chi^2=28.32485$ (保留两位为 28.32), $df=1$, $p\\approx1.03\\times10^{-7}$. 大于 $\\chi^2_{0.99,1}=6.6349$, 在 $\\alpha=0.01$ 下拒绝独立性假设, 吸烟状态与肺病存在统计关联"
          }
        ],
        "explanation": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$E_{ij}=R_iC_j/N$, $\\chi^2=\\sum(O-E)^2/E$, 使用未提前舍入的期望频数得到 28.32; 若逐项及中间值按两位舍入可能有末位差异. 必须先核对题干 200 与表格 205 的冲突"
          }
        ],
